WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.934 --> 00:00:17.253
"Yay!" said Harry.

2
00:00:17.254 --> 00:00:26.960
"We're going camping!"

3
00:00:26.961 --> 00:00:30.681
Mom put the tent and food in the car.

4
00:00:30.682 --> 00:00:37.497
Dad put the sleeping bags in the car.

5
00:00:37.498 --> 00:00:40.641
The kids played in the yard.

6
00:00:40.642 --> 00:00:47.043
Harry threw a stick.

7
00:00:47.044 --> 00:00:50.610
Rover ran after it.

8
00:00:50.611 --> 00:00:53.810
"Everybody in the car!" Dad said.

9
00:00:53.811 --> 00:00:59.121
Rover looked for the stick.

10
00:00:59.122 --> 00:01:02.795
"It's time to go camping, Rover," said Harry.

11
00:01:02.796 --> 00:01:12.830
Rover was still looking for the stick.

12
00:01:12.831 --> 00:01:20.472
Everybody pulled Rover into the car.

13
00:01:20.473 --> 00:01:23.784
"Here we go!" said Dad.

14
00:01:23.785 --> 00:01:36.526
Dad drove, and Rover barked loudly.

15
00:01:36.527 --> 00:01:41.729
Soon they were in the woods.

16
00:01:41.730 --> 00:01:50.544
Mom and Harry set up the tent.

17
00:01:50.545 --> 00:01:57.506
Dad and Emmy made a campfire.

18
00:01:57.507 --> 00:02:01.951
Oliver found bugs.

19
00:02:01.952 --> 00:02:07.316
Rover sniffed all around.

20
00:02:07.317 --> 00:02:11.403
Dad cooked dinner over the fire.

21
00:02:11.404 --> 00:02:19.105
Everybody ate.

22
00:02:19.106 --> 00:02:22.013
"It's getting dark," said Dad.

23
00:02:22.014 --> 00:02:25.670
"We need to tie up our food.

24
00:02:25.671 --> 00:02:29.827
There are bears in the woods."

25
00:02:29.828 --> 00:02:32.901
"Bears?" Harry looked around.

26
00:02:32.902 --> 00:02:36.154
"Bears?" Emmy looked around.

27
00:02:36.155 --> 00:02:41.024
"I like bears," said Oliver.

28
00:02:41.025 --> 00:02:43.700
Suddenly the bushes moved.

29
00:02:43.701 --> 00:02:50.040
"Is it a bear?" asked Emmy.

30
00:02:50.041 --> 00:02:52.761
A sound came from the bushes.

31
00:02:52.762 --> 00:03:02.178
"It must be a bear," said Harry.

32
00:03:02.179 --> 00:03:06.167
"Woof! Woof!" Rover jumped out.

33
00:03:06.168 --> 00:03:12.376
Rover had a new stick.
